meta {
  name: Get All Reminder Scheduler History
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reminder/history
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Reminder Scheduler History

  This request is used to get all executed reminder history. This request interacts with the MySql database, has protected routes, and has a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Reminder history fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `last_execute`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "reminder history fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "inventory_name": "Skintific Mugwort Clay Mask",
          "reminder_desc": "Restock at https://tokopedia.link/rBfBm3vVDIb\r\nBeli 2 boleh",
          "reminder_type": "Every Month",
          "reminder_context": "Every 19",
          "last_execute": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login | only admin can use this request"
  }
```

  **404 — reminder history failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "reminder history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}